Cell["\<\
BinaryTensorNetwork is the constructive inverse of BinaryTensorNetworkQ: it \
inserts one spider tensor per hyperedge index so the result is binary. On an \
already-binary network it acts as the identity:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->503030005,ExpressionUUID->"7a1f10c2-3a25-4d3a-8b1e-1a2bd8a9e027"],

